    "note": "fire loops every 36 frames (one rotor turn) and fires each barrel once, as it passes the top, in the order listed, 6 frames apart: spawn the hitscan and the muzzle flash at that barrel's muzzle gizmo on its frame. spin_up and spin_down end the rotor on whole turns; fire_start is fire's first pass (no earlier shots still recoiling), so spin_up -> fire_start -> fire (loop) -> spin_down chain without a jump."
  },
