    "home_frames": 15,
    "note": "each barrel is a slide bone (Barrel<n>, local +Y back along its axis) in the rotor's clamps; as it fires it recoils 1 cm back in 15 frames (fast, then slowing) and returns in 15 (1 s in all), its rear end running deeper into a blind bore in the bolt drum"
  },
