  "ammo": {
    "mesh": "SM_MinigunAmmo in minigun_ammo.glb, at the AmmoMount gizmo",
    "bone": "Mag",
    "pickup_file": "minigun_ammo.glb",
    "pickup_mesh": "SM_MinigunAmmo",
    "pickup_origin": "its bottom centre",
    "rails_m": 0.015,
    "note": "mag_release opens the latch and runs the pack down its rails; past MAG_TRAVEL it is free: hide SK_MinigunAmmo and drop a physics copy of the pickup mesh at the Mag bone's transform. To reload, put the pack back at the end of its rails and play mag_insert."
  },
  "usage": "trigger down: spin_up, then fire_start, then fire (loop) while it is held; trigger up: spin_down. mag_release / mag_insert to swap the pack. Pistons are baked into the animations; rebuild their aim constraints only for procedural poses.",
